New production cost:

- one narrow coordinator task;
- O(worker count) bounded channel slots and worker identifiers;
- one specialized `ComputeExchangeDelta` and ephemeral planning scratch;
- ordered retained-batch planning and a stronger Ready-prefix classifier.

The scheduler owns a bounded virtual exchange view that merges the current
fair queues with completion removals and new checkouts while advancing the
same lane cursors as sequential checkout. It does not clone the complete
scheduler. The resource module similarly owns a bounded virtual aggregate and
per-peer compiler and emits one `ResourceBatchPlan`. These domain-owned
compilers prevent the coordinator from manually publishing projection deltas.

