- per-worker authority checkout, settlement-retry and role-specific wake
  loops;
- separate Resolve/Verify-small/Verify-any Notify routing and their manual
  publication branches;
- repeated per-owner scheduler/resource/index/dependency Apply construction
  on the common compute path;
